nput-to-paint perf harness, no-egui-textedit gate, IME/clipboard/focus tests, font fallback, wrapping, degraded banners, zero-egress smoke. Rectangular selection explicitly deferred. | Closed |\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-REVIEW.md:16:| Blocker | Fixed | `crates/devil-desktop/src/workflow.rs` | Open-path prompt text and paste events could route into the active editor because keyboard handling ran before the prompt UI and routed `egui::Event::Text` unconditionally. `egui::Event::Paste` also had no direct desktop event handling despite an existing `ClipboardPaste` action. | `handle_keyboard` now gates editor text input while `open_path_prompt` is active and routes both text and paste through `editor_text_input_actions`. Regression tests cover prompt-active suppression and editor-enabled text/paste routing. |\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-REVIEW.md:38:- `cargo deny check` continues to emit duplicate-crate warnings in renderer/windowing transitive dependencies while exiting 0 under current policy.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CRITIQUE.md:39:| Headline | Phase 2 failed because renderer proof was documented but not generated by an executable command. |\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CRITIQUE.md:69:| Mitigation Applied | Plan 02-01 now gates on `cargo run -p xtask -- check-deps`, `cargo check -p devil-desktop --all-targets`, and the exact renderer dependency regression test. |\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CRITIQUE.md:99:| `devil-desktop` can depend on `devil-app`, `devil-ui`, `devil-protocol`, `eframe`, and `egui` under current policy. | Dependency | High | Strong | Accepted | Verified from Phase 1 readiness, ADR-0030, dependency policy, and `xtask` gate. |\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:9:- Phase 1 readiness source: `.planning/phases/01-baseline-reconciliation-and-renderer-decision/01-REVIEW.md` and `plans/evidence/gui-productization/phase-1-renderer-readiness.md`.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:15:- Phase 1 review passed on 2026-05-26 after the renderer dependency gate was fixed to check every workspace package except `devil-desktop`.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:16:- `plans/evidence/gui-productization/phase-1-renderer-readiness.md` accepts `eframe`/`egui` as the Phase 2 Windows-first foundation renderer proof path and records Slint/custom fallback criteria.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:17:- `plans/adrs/ADR-0030-desktop-adapter-boundary.md` defines `devil-desktop` as an adapter that owns renderer resources, native input translation, metrics, and accessibility publication, but not editor/workspace/proposal authority.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:18:- `plans/dependency-policy.md` authorizes renderer/windowing dependencies only in `devil-desktop`; `xtask/src/main.rs` enforces this through `validate_renderer_dependency_gate`.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:29:- `devil-desktop` exists as the only renderer-backed crate or binary.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:33:- `devil-ui` and core crates do not depend on renderer/windowing crates or `devil-desktop`.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:40:- Wave 3: Plan 02-04 connects the renderer shell to `AppComposition` for open/edit/save/rejection/quit workflows.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:41:- Wave 4: Plan 02-05 adds renderer timing and platform smoke evidence capture.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:46:- Preserve projection-only UI. `devil-ui` must not depend on `eframe`, `egui`, `devil-desktop`, `devil-app`, editor, project, storage, workspace, provider, terminal, telemetry, remote, plugin, collaboration, retention, or AI runtime crates.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:48:- Preserve renderer dependency isolation. Only `devil-desktop` may declare renderer/windowing/accessibility crates authorized by ADR-0002 and dependency policy.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:50:- Verify before reporting completion. Phase 2 cannot be accepted from screenshots or documentation alone if code gates, smoke tests, or renderer-boundary checks fail.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:57:2. The initial decomposition mixed app authority routing with visual rendering. Plans 02-02 and 02-03 now split projection rendering from intent/app-request bridging so `devil-ui` cannot accidentally gain renderer or app ownership.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-CONTEXT.md:58:3. The initial scaffold did not make `xtask check-deps` a first-wave gate. Plan 02-01 now requires the workspace member, dependency policy compatibility, and renderer gate to pass before any rendering work proceeds.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-06-SUMMARY.md:5:Phase 2 now has a final accepted evidence document at `plans/evidence/gui-productization/phase-2-renderer-foundation.md`. The evidence inventories all upstream Phase 2 artifacts, records the renderer boundary, workflow routing, smoke data, live gate results, success-criteria decisions, residual risks, and Phase 3 entry criteria.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02-renderer-backed-foundation-mode\\02-06-RESULT.md:9:- `plans/evidence/gui-productization/phase-2-renderer-foundation.md`: added the final Phase 2 acceptance evidence, artifact inventory, boundary/workflow proof, gate table, success-criteria decision, residual risks, and Phase 3 entry criteria.\r\n.\\.planning\\phases\\02